### Health
GET http://localhost:3000/

### Register Volunteer
POST http://localhost:3000/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Relawan Demo",
  "email": "relawan@example.com",
  "password": "relawan123",
  "role": "volunteer",
  "phone": "081234567890",
  "address": "Yogyakarta",
  "skills": "Medis, Logistik"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@bnpb.go.id",
  "password": "admin12345"
}

### Set token setelah login
@token = isi_token_di_sini

### Get Profile
GET http://localhost:3000/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Disasters
GET http://localhost:3000/disasters
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Disaster
POST http://localhost:3000/api/disasters
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Banjir Sleman",
  "type": "Banjir",
  "description": "Wilayah terdampak membutuhkan bantuan medis dan logistik.",
  "location": "Sleman, Yogyakarta",
  "latitude": -7.7320,
  "longitude": 110.4020,
  "severity": "high",
  "disaster_date": "2026-05-23",
  "status": "active"
}

### Get Volunteers
GET http://localhost:3000/api/volunteers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Assignment
POST http://localhost:3000/api/assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "volunteer_id": 1,
  "disaster_id": 1,
  "shelter_id": 1,
  "assignment_status": "assigned",
  "notes": "Bantu distribusi logistik di posko utama."
}

### Update Realtime Location Firestore
POST http://localhost:3000/api/realtime/locations/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Relawan Demo",
  "latitude": -7.8879,
  "longitude": 110.3289,
  "status": "available"
}

### Nearby Volunteers Firestore
GET http://localhost:3000/api/realtime/locations/nearby?lat=-7.8881&lng=110.3288&radiusKm=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Emergency Broadcast Firestore
POST http://localhost:3000/api/realtime/broadcasts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Butuh Relawan Medis",
  "location": "Bantul, Yogyakarta",
  "need": "10 relawan medis dan 5 relawan logistik",
  "priority": "high",
  "disaster_id": 1
}

### Send Coordination Chat Firestore
POST http://localhost:3000/api/realtime/chats/disaster-1/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sender_id": 1,
  "sender_name": "Admin BNPB",
  "message": "Tim logistik segera menuju posko utama."
}
